{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/272cc06586d1a40d563713ef55a014f0.avif?t=1770992769\" width=630 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chronicles of Overlord</strong> is a tactical RPG set in a world torn apart by war between humans, elves, orcs, and other races. An ancient evil known as the Devourer threatens to consume the world, and only the Overlord\u2014a resurrected master of necromancy\u2014is aware of the approaching catastrophe. To prevent the annihilation of all life, he must seize four legendary artifacts, each guarded by the mighty rulers of their peoples.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level presents a new challenge that demands a unique approach. Master thoughtful positioning, combine your heroes' skills and spells, and make smart use of artifacts and magical potions to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/f94b654dee8a639551107b86787617ec.poster.avif?t=1770992769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/f94b654dee8a639551107b86787617ec.webm?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/f94b654dee8a639551107b86787617ec.mp4?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Heroes &amp; Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a diverse cast of heroes, each with their own unique set of abilities and combat role. Extensive character progression allows you to adapt your strategy to any scenario and respond effectively to the unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/eb7955a61b209cd4eb06136076e37761.poster.avif?t=1770992769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/eb7955a61b209cd4eb06136076e37761.webm?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/eb7955a61b209cd4eb06136076e37761.mp4?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an original fantasy setting, brought to life with coherent world-building and distinct factions, each with their own approach to war. Your choices in dialogue and immersive cutscenes pull you deeper into the world of the Overlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/5df052b2504d93680d44105f089f556a.poster.avif?t=1770992769\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/5df052b2504d93680d44105f089f556a.webm?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/5df052b2504d93680d44105f089f556a.mp4?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modern Pixel-Art Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a visually stunning blend of classic pixel art and modern visual techniques. Dynamic lighting, detailed spell animations, and carefully crafted scenes give the game a expressive and contemporary feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/338ba002454a07dd160dac723fbd69de.avif?t=1770992769\" width=1560 height=1122 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2150210?t=1770992769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/708bb762f16ea579208595e88f92177328189868/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770992769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/55a86a0d2ceae0ac44052663ff1ab37e915f5648/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770992769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/55a86a0d2ceae0ac44052663ff1ab37e915f5648/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770992769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3247580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/272cc06586d1a40d563713ef55a014f0.avif?t=1770992769\" width=630 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Chronicles of Overlord</strong> is a tactical RPG set in a world torn apart by war between humans, elves, orcs, and other races. An ancient evil known as the Devourer threatens to consume the world, and only the Overlord\u2014a resurrected master of necromancy\u2014is aware of the approaching catastrophe. To prevent the annihilation of all life, he must seize four legendary artifacts, each guarded by the mighty rulers of their peoples.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Depth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level presents a new challenge that demands a unique approach. Master thoughtful positioning, combine your heroes' skills and spells, and make smart use of artifacts and magical potions to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/f94b654dee8a639551107b86787617ec.poster.avif?t=1770992769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/f94b654dee8a639551107b86787617ec.webm?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/f94b654dee8a639551107b86787617ec.mp4?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Heroes &amp; Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a diverse cast of heroes, each with their own unique set of abilities and combat role. Extensive character progression allows you to adapt your strategy to any scenario and respond effectively to the unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/eb7955a61b209cd4eb06136076e37761.poster.avif?t=1770992769\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/eb7955a61b209cd4eb06136076e37761.webm?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/eb7955a61b209cd4eb06136076e37761.mp4?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich Fantasy World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an original fantasy setting, brought to life with coherent world-building and distinct factions, each with their own approach to war. Your choices in dialogue and immersive cutscenes pull you deeper into the world of the Overlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/5df052b2504d93680d44105f089f556a.poster.avif?t=1770992769\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/5df052b2504d93680d44105f089f556a.webm?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/5df052b2504d93680d44105f089f556a.mp4?t=1770992769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modern Pixel-Art Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a visually stunning blend of classic pixel art and modern visual techniques. Dynamic lighting, detailed spell animations, and carefully crafted scenes give the game a expressive and contemporary feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/extras/338ba002454a07dd160dac723fbd69de.avif?t=1770992769\" width=1560 height=1122 /></span></p>","developers":["Blind Archer Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150210/5a03dcf31bf3ad3255613b5de3010e046d5acd5b/header.jpg?t=1770992769","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirem